           :   │     t1: PgSearchScan: table=p, segments=3, fetch=[category], visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"description","query_string":"widget","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
           :   │     t2: PgSearchScan: table=p, segments=3, fetch=[category], visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"description","query_string":"widget","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
           :   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────
